OL,3,GNEWSAHeart trial after breast cancer
OL,4,Ahas 'improved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA breast cancer survivor says she no
OL,7,Flonger lives "with the same fear" after
OL,8,Fa clinical trial enabled her to stop
OL,9,Fthe heart medication she needed
OL,10,Ffollowing cancer treatment.
OL,12,FLucy Shepherd, from Hertfordshire, was
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with triple positive breast
OL,14,Fcancer shortly after her 33rd birthday,
OL,15,Fbut a routine scan revealed that her
OL,16,Fheart function had declined during
OL,17,Fcare.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
