OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHeart trial after breast cancer
OL,4,Ahas 'improved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new study, described as "hugely
OL,7,Fencouraging" for patients, has found
OL,8,Fthe majority of breast cancer survivors
OL,9,Fwhose treatment caused heart problems
OL,10,Fmay not need to be on precautionary
OL,11,Fmedication for life.
OL,13,F"Being part of the trial and having the
OL,14,Fchance to come off my heart medication
OL,15,Fhas definitely improved my life,"
OL,16,FShepherd said.
